First, it is important to clarify precisely how the Agency Agreement will work – which is not as you describe.&nbsp; We hope this gives you immediate comfort with the approach.


PG’s proposed role is exactly as envisaged in the Pan NOx Agency Agreement, which we have all been working under: PG will, as authorised by the Pan NOx Agency Agreement, act by authorisation of LD with respect
 to the Common Work delegated to it by LD.&nbsp; The Agency Agreement will enable PG to continue working on the liability trial and quantum workstream while you remain with us working your notice period - this agreement&nbsp;is intended to ensure that you can continue
 to work as currently on the existing work plans with the Lead Solicitor. &nbsp;With Alicia, I will continue to have strategic input and meaningful involvement.&nbsp;It is a pragmatic solution to the various concerns.

