ty (SRA) under firm number 647886. &nbsp;“Heminsley Law” is a trading name/style of Heminsley. It should be noted that while the owners/directors of the companies in the partnership are not, technically, themselves partners, Heminsley refers to them as ‘non-member partners’ or as simply ‘partners’.&nbsp; A list of these directors/non-member partners is available for inspection at our registered office, which is at Enterprise House, 656 Chester Road, Birmingham B23 5TE.&nbsp; VAT registration number: 293 7561 64. &nbsp;&nbsp;From: Natasha Geraldo Baird &lt;ngeraldobaird@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 11 December 2025 09:23To: Jemma O'Reilly &lt;Jemma.Oreilly@heminsleylaw.com&gt;Cc: Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: Legally Privileged &amp; Confidential&nbsp;Hi Jemma,&nbsp;Thanks for your time on the phone just now. &nbsp;Please see the email below - we would appreciate your assistance with a response please.&nbsp;We don’t need Michael back for the 12 and the 15 December so we will pay him for those two days – we can explain that we are doing this for him to be able to focus on his health, given he is currently signed off. &nbsp;Let me know if you need any other information e.g. sick note etc.&nbsp;Thanks in advance.&nbsp;Tash ​​​​Natasha&nbsp;Geraldo&nbsp;BairdHead&nbsp;of&nbsp;HR+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;643This email and any attachments are confidential and may also be privileged. If you receive this message in error, please contact the sender immediately, destroy the email and any attachments and do not use, copy, store or disclose this email and any attachments for any purpose. Pogust Goodhead does not accept service of documents by electronic means without express prior agreement.&nbsp;Pogust Goodhead is the trading name of&nbsp;PGMBM Law Ltd, a&nbsp;limited liability company registered in England and Wales (no. 6284764) with its&nbsp;registered office at&nbsp;53-64 Chancery House, Chancery Lane, London WC2A 1QS&nbsp;and authori